WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
The reform you want to make

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:02,440
It’s for the whole company

3
00:00:02,680 --> 00:00:05,360
From the inside to all subordinate stores, but

4
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:07,280
So far no one knows the news

5
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:08,600
Only a few senior executives know

6
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:10,880
You know a lot, that's true

7
00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:12,640
Because it involves the interests of all aspects

8
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:14,120
So in order not to cause conflicts

9
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:15,440
Must be kept confidential

10
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:17,080
Such a sudden announcement and then proceed

11
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:18,440
Can reduce a lot of trouble

12
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:19,800
I already told the secretary

13
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,520
Send your plan to these senior executives

14
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:22,920
Then ask the secretary to notify the extension

15
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,080
Wait until you return to the company

16
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:25,400
Is there something wrong with you, Chu Yundong?

17
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:26,760
It’s okay if you ask for leave for me.

18
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:28,360
You send them this plan in advance

19
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:30,800
This is leaking company secrets. Do you know what the consequences are?

20
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:32,120
Can you bear the responsibility?

21
00:00:32,360 --> 00:00:35,440
It's too late to call him and tell him to stop and not send it out.

22
00:00:35,720 --> 00:00:37,720
I asked him to send it to you immediately

23
00:00:38,240 --> 00:00:39,920
I overstepped my authority by not asking you first.

24
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:41,240
But first listen to me finish my reasons

25
00:00:41,360 --> 00:00:42,280
It's up to you to decide what to do

26
00:00:42,360 --> 00:00:43,840
Zhang Yuhan, your idea is fine

27
00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:45,200
But have you thought about a question?

28
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:47,360
You dropped a bombshell as soon as you came up.

29
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:49,740
Even give people a little buffer

30
00:00:49,740 --> 00:00:50,900
No room for thinking

31
00:00:51,340 --> 00:00:53,060
You blew everyone's brains out.

32
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:54,460
How do you want everyone to try it?

33
00:00:55,380 --> 00:00:56,700
What I worry about is that given the time

34
00:00:56,700 --> 00:00:58,180
They messed up the reform first.

35
00:00:58,340 --> 00:00:59,540
Are you afraid of being reformed?

36
00:00:59,540 --> 00:01:01,180
People who have harmed interests interfere with it

37
00:01:01,180 --> 00:01:03,460
Have you ever thought about doing something harmful to the company?

38
00:01:03,460 --> 00:01:04,740
They want to harm the company's interests

39
00:01:04,860 --> 00:01:07,380
Could it be that after you announced your plan and tried it immediately, they wouldn’t do it?

40
00:01:07,380 --> 00:01:08,540
Has it harmed the interests of the company?
